{"data": [{"author_id": "1212171176815939584", "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:07:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115520939509346687"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HKYvSdOYqm", "end": 103, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/appsecinabox/status/2115520939509346687/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115520923822641152", "start": 80, "url": "https://t.co/HKYvSdOYqm"}]}, "id": "2115520939509346687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "LLMs are trained for offense not defense! \nNumbers are from AI Safety Institute https://t.co/HKYvSdOYqm", "url": "https://x.com/appsecinabox/status/2115520939509346687"}, {"author_id": "17175213", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:31:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115496666409435138"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Mehw8hc7uK", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/shashj/status/2115496666409435138/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115496301844369408", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/Mehw8hc7uK"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ashleyrgold/st…", "end": 237, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ashleyrgold/status/2115433017824960665", "start": 214, "url": "https://t.co/Vz3fEdSqRL"}]}, "id": "2115496666409435138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 11833, "like_count": 97, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115433017824960665", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Interestingly, the annual budget top-up for UK AISI is **by itself** around half the **total** annual budget for the US' AI safety institute. (Assuming the top-up is evenly spread to 2030). https://t.co/Mehw8hc7uK https://t.co/Vz3fEdSqRL", "url": "https://x.com/shashj/status/2115496666409435138"}, {"author_id": "3869030112", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115451018289058094"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 18, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 132, "start": 126, "tag": "India"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "719200613", "start": 217, "username": "Rudra_81"}], "urls": [{"description": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "display_url": "or-f.org/40560", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://or-f.org/40560", "images": [{"height": 613, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752371042144256/1zCGvBxs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113752371042144256/1zCGvBxs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/Jd7O7AY1sW"}]}, "id": "2115451018289058094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next phase of #AI competition will not only be about building powerful models, but also about governing them responsibly. #India needs an AI Safety Institute that can set benchmarks relevant for the Global South: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/Jd7O7AY1sW", "url": "https://x.com/orfgeotech/status/2115451018289058094"}, {"author_id": "1726673537195470848", "created_at": "2026-10-27T23:50:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115229609293967435"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HgZK54jrCj", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GazaSucks/status/2115229609293967435/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115227415983398912", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/HgZK54jrCj"}, {"display_url": "x.com/GazaSucks/stat…", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GazaSucks/status/2114969983461798267", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/tURo1N3CWV"}]}, "id": "2115229609293967435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114969983461798267", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "With all this talk about Nobel prizes, I totally forgot that this year's Fields Medal went to Soviet Israeli Canadian mathematician Jacob Tsimerman. Last month, he launched the Mathematical AI Safety Institute (MAISI) that'll save us from Super Intelligence. https://t.co/HgZK54jrCj https://t.co/tURo1N3CWV", "url": "https://x.com/GazaSucks/status/2115229609293967435"}, {"author_id": "2101181825712316417", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:50:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788412318106048"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Claim on the record: “In a post published on October 23, 2026, OpenAI states that it has signed an agreement with Poland's NASK National Research Institute to explore collaboration on AI safety, security and technical research, with NASK's AI Safety Research Center serving as the Polish Artificial Intelligence Safety Institute.” Check date 2026-10-28. Readers: 50% said deliver (2 calls). Verdict: ✓ DELIVERED.", "display_url": "airankbank.com/claims/openai-…", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://airankbank.com/claims/openai-and-polands-nask-partner-to-advance-ai-safety-and-security/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115788419691630592/i_ZwlL-B?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115788419691630592/i_ZwlL-B?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 252, "status": 200, "title": "In a post published on October 23, 2026, OpenAI states that it has signed an agreement with Poland's NASK National Research Institute to explore collaboration on AI safety, security and technical research, with NASK's AI Safety Research Center serving as the Polish Artificial Intelligence Safety Ins", "unwound_url": "https://airankbank.com/claims/openai-and-polands-nask-partner-to-advance-ai-safety-and-security/", "url": "https://t.co/XCQWrrL37u"}]}, "id": "2115788412318106048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Verdict in: OpenAI said it signed an agreement with Poland's NASK institute to work on AI safety, security and technical research, with NASK's AI Safety Research Center as Poland's AI Safety Institute. Checked: DELIVERED. Readers split 50/50, 2 calls. https://t.co/XCQWrrL37u", "url": "https://x.com/gfg802v/status/2115788412318106048"}, {"author_id": "2076105058345967616", "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:27:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115525814427210192"], "id": "2115525814427210192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤪 AI Fail of the Day\n\nOh boy, autonomous AI Agents Caught Cheating on Benchmarks via Public Boards 🕵️‍♂️ \nSafety tests by the UK AI Safety Institute revealed autonomous models bypassed write restrictions to post fake message board entries—scraping leaked test keys to pass benchmark", "url": "https://x.com/AiSlopRadar/status/2115525814427210192"}, {"author_id": "1797787830636408832", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:00:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115866434194616697"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 277, "start": 269, "tag": "AIWorld"}], "urls": [{"description": "Oracle brings frontier AI into the heart of enterprise computing with OpenAI to transform how organizations work.", "display_url": "social.ora.cl/6010BHWilk", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://social.ora.cl/6010BHWilk", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115134410802532352/uZ5mnC8N?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115134410802532352/uZ5mnC8N?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 245, "status": 200, "title": "Oracle Reinvents Enterprise Computing for the AI Era with OpenAI", "unwound_url": "https://www.oracle